msgid "Specify Composer Packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/general/modules.rst:127
msgid ""
"To avoid wasting time scanning for irrelevant Composer packages, you can "
"manually specify packages to discover by editing the "
"``$composerPackages`` variable in **app/Config/Modules.php**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/general/modules.rst:131
msgid "Alternatively, you can specify which packages to exclude from discovery."
msgstr ""

